\item[S2] Goddyn, Luis A., A conjecture on iterated circumcentres, Open Problem Garden, node 357. Complete problem, discussion and bibliography (including mathematical image alt text). \url{https://www.openproblemgarden.org/op/a_conjecture_on_iterated_circumcentres}.
